==Description==
'''Tanky Enemies''' is a modifier which adds the [[Tank (Attribute)|Tank]] attribute to all enemies.

==Effects==
When active, all enemies will spawn with the [[Tank (Attribute)|Tank]] attribute, reducing most sources of damage to 1.

